WEBVTT

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.890
(INSECT AND BIRD NOISES)

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:42.610
(EXHAUSTED BREATHING)

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.610
What a trooper.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.170
I'm so proud of you.

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.130
Thanks, Mom.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
I think your father
is in trouble.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.770
If you haven't noticed,
we're not doing so hot
either.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.330
I'm going to
look for him.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:08.250
And that means you're
in charge until I get
back, Violet.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:09.290
What?

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:10.530
You heard her.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:16.530
Put these on.
Your identity is your
most valuable possession.

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:17.930
Protect it.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.090
And if anything goes wrong,
use your powers.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:21.290
But you said
never to use...

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.370
I know what I said!

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.650
Remember the bad guys

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.570
on those shows
you used to watch
on Saturday mornings?

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:34.130
Well, these guys
are not like those guys.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.890
They won't exercise
restraint because
you're children.

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.250
They will kill you
if they get the chance.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.650
Do not give them
that chance.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:45.490
Mom?
Vi, I'm counting on you.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:46.570
There's...

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:48.690
I'm counting on you.
Be strong.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.850
Dash, if anything
goes wrong,

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.130
I want you to run
as fast as you can.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.490
As fast as I can?

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.010
As fast as you can.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:00.770
Stay hidden.
Keep each other safe.
I'll be back by morning.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.330
VIOLET: Mom!

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:09.850
Mom, what happened on
the plane. I'm sorry.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.090
(STAMMERING)
I wanted to help.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:12.930
When you asked me to...
I'm sorry.

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:15.330
Shh. It isn't your fault.

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:18.970
It wasn't fair
for me to suddenly
ask so much of you.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:21.610
But things are
different now.

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.730
And doubt is a luxury
we can't afford anymore,
sweetie.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:27.090
You have more power
than you realize.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.930
Don't think.
And don't worry.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.570
If the time comes,
you'll know what to do.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.250
(LAUGHS)
It's in your blood.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.730
He's not weak,
you know.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:15.890
What?

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.290
Valuing life
is not weakness.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:22.170
Hey. Look, if you're
talking about what happened
in the containment unit,

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.930
I had everything
under control.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.850
And disregarding it
is not strength.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.770
I called his bluff,
sweetheart, that's all.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.290
I knew he wouldn't
have it in him to
actually...

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.170
Next time you gamble,
bet your own life!

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.770
Okay, okay, okay.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.930
(VOICES ON RADIO)

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.570
A rocket?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.610
(SIGHS, GASPS)

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.090
Hey!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.450
(STRUGGLING)

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.170
Well, not that
this isn't fun,

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.610
but I'm gonna go
look around.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:48.490
What do you think
is going on here?

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:50.690
You think
we're on vacation?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:53.970
Mom and Dad's lives
could be in jeopardy.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.290
Or worse,
(WHISPERING) their marriage.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.170
Their marriage?

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.970
So, the bad guys
are trying to wreck
Mom and Dad's marriage.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.170
Forget it.
You're so immature.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.810
I'm gonna go
look around.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.490
Mom said to stay hidden.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.410
I'm not gonna leave
the cave. Sheesh.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.570
(VOICES OVER RADIO)

